WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:09.000
The clinic's test began with three impressive numbers. The insulin model's R squared of 0.401

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.760
borrowed strength from a same test measurement and a selected complete case sample. The 77% accuracy

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:25.320
borrowed confidence from in-sample evaluation and a majority-friendly metric. Glucose's large effect

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:33.360
earned its strength through 5-year prediction. The result I would build on is glucose. The models

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:39.240
I would distrust are the ones whose strongest numbers disappear when their design is examined.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.840
Earned strength guides the clinic. Borrowed strength stays in the report.
